{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_09_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_09",
  "title": "走出密林",
  "storyCode": "RI-9",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6c773b44aa89f81581134463b1b946f26afe70a7c7d186dc248b1ca59840d2a1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "结束了，特米米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "......还、还没有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "努尔，佩塔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "text": "博士——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "不想让你的同伴受到伤害的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "别逼我生气啊，特米米！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "......嘉维尔你不留下来的话，我是不会收手的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "救我啊，博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "text": "博士，我好怕呜呜呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "交给你的任务完成了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "迪伦",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "博士，别这么不上道嘛，小姑娘这么情真意切，配合一下又不会死。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
              "text": "唉，这里的人这么淳朴，老实说，欺骗他们让我有些良心不安呢，虽然我没有心。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "迪伦",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "哎呀，博士，你别用那种眼神看着我。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "迪伦",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "安心，我怎么也是罗德岛的干员，这点小事都做不好怎么行。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "不要怕！我这就来救你们！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
              "text": "博士——！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Lancet-2！",
          "value": "4",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "诶？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "什么时候挣脱的！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "迪伦",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "哈哈，抱歉啊，其实从一开始就没绑住。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "博士，难道你早就料到了特米米会这么做？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "博士——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迪伦",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哇，你们两个演的比我还起劲啊。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "当然。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "想不发现才难。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "你你你、你是怎么发现的？！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "首先，是你在第一次提到祖玛玛时出现的犹豫。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？犹豫？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "然后，是在祭典时，你对嘉维尔突然行动的惊慌。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "......"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "最后，迪伦，东西呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迪伦",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哦，我放在Lancet-2身上了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "呜呜......要不是为了博士，我可不会轻易让人在我身体里放东西哦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "这是......火箭筒？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迪伦",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "对，在特米米的部族里找到的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "难道说......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迪伦",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "没错，把我们轰下来的罪魁祸首，就是这个小丫头啦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "特米米。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "呜呜呜，我错了，嘉维尔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "过来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "呜呜呜......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "趴到我大腿上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "嘉维尔，你不要打我，我知道错了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "那可不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "对付不听话的小鬼，当然要打尾巴！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "呜呜呜......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "打尾巴，好像很痛的样子......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "知道错了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "知道错了，呜呜呜......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "知道错了就好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "总之，这下应该算是没事了，博士。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "累了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "哈哈哈，确实这一连串发生的事还挺多的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "喂，博士，你该不会站着睡着了吧。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你刚才居然没有用那招什么大风车。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "我当然不伤到特米米这孩子啊。唉，我可是都有点累了。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "这个大家伙......乍一看虽然好像很丑，但是这个棱角，粗犷的设计感，杂乱却有效的线路连接，仔细看看有一种独特的美。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "嗯，是适合结婚的类型呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "哦，Lancet-2，你快去看看引擎还有没有救。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "诶？难道引擎在这个大家伙身上？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "对啊，被我们打爆了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "哇，可怜的引擎，可怜的大个子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "迪伦先生，可以过来帮我个忙吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迪伦",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "好嘞。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "喂，祖玛玛，你怎么了，傻站在那儿。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嘉维尔，嘉维尔！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？干什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "那个，那个！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "哪个啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "那个，那个会动会说话的机器是怎么回事！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "哦，你说Lancet-2啊，她是我们的同伴啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我、我可以和她说话吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "这有什么不行的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "那个，你好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "你好？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "你是机器吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "我的产品名称是雷神存在者S—Typer62六轮作业平台，隶属罗德岛，代号Lancet-2。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "哦哦！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "是的，我拥有一定程度的智能，如果是不怎么困难的问题的话，我应该可以为你解答。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "顺便一提，作为面向医疗的作业平台，我的知识储备偏向医疗方面，这点还请注意哦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "^%&$*#(#......！！！！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "有什么事吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我可以抱抱你吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "诶？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "那家伙在干什么啊，脑子进水了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "这不是很明显吗，她被那台机器震慑了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "就像她第一次见到移动城市时的震撼一样，一台能自己行动，还会自己说话的机器对她的冲击，比那还要大！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "别说她了，我也兴奋得不行好吗！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "噢，这位美丽的小姐，我可以有幸邀请你进行一次约会吗！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我知道这片雨林中景色最美的地方，让我们去那里度过一个美好的下午吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "咦，我、我被邀请了吗？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "怎么办，稍微有点开心......博士，我应该接受吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "接受吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "森蚺",
              "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
              "text": "大祭司，你不要抢，不然别怪我不顾我们这么多年的情谊。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "老实说，我现在和博士心情相同。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "有点想笑。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "不准抢走我的Lancet-2！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
              "text": "诶，博士，你忽然这样说，我还没有做好心理准备......"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嘉维尔，你们那里能造出这样的机器吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？呃，我觉得可露希尔应该可以吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "好。我决定了，嘉维尔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "你的那个叫罗德岛的地方还缺人吗，我也要加入你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我要去你们那里学习机械技术。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "哈？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我虽然也想过去外面学习，但因为部族的关系一直没有认真考虑这件事，现在我觉得这是个好机会。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "那、那我也要去！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "什么？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "既然这样的话，只能启用备用计划了.......我只要跟着嘉维尔就可以了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "嘉维尔，我也有战斗的能力，一定能帮上嘉维尔的忙的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "呃，博士，这怎么办？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "可以来，但结果不保证。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "也是，干员测试反正都可以做。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "诶，博士，你可别欺负她啊。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你惹的，我不管。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "博——士——！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "算了，反正你也先跟着博士学点本事好了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "嗯！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "喂，嘉维尔，来帮我翻译一下这家伙在说什么。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "燧石",
          "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？克玛尔？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "燧石",
          "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
          "text": "我要跟随她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "她说她要跟你走。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "哦，行啊。她还挺能打的，当干员应该没啥问题。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "她说行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "燧石",
          "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
          "text": "好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嗯？等等，那祖玛玛要走，特米米要走，克玛尔也要走，部族们怎么办？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你之前走的时候怎么不想想。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊哈哈，我那时候正在气头上嘛！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "确实......我不能放下我的部族不管。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "噢，关于这个，我想你们不用很担心！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "虽然不如嘉维尔，不过大丑果然还是很强啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "没错没错，我也想造一个玩。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "反正神庙也毁了，干脆来比造机器好了，谁造的厉害谁当大酋长怎么样？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人D",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "喂，还是打架爽啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "诶，也对啊，打架也难以放弃，这可怎么办。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哎呀，你们傻啊，一边打架一边比机器不就好了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人们",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "这个好！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你看，事实上，你们完全没必要担心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "根据我的观察，领导者在为未来焦头烂额的时候，其实普通人反而是适应得最快的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "要是我告诉你们，第一任大酋长其实是两百年前一个提亚卡乌勇士自封的，在那之前，根本没有选大酋长的习惯，你们会怎么想？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......大祭司，你怎么从来没有告诉过我这件事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "噢，我认为这并不重要，不是吗？我只是想告诉你，人们很顽强，他们是不会因为一个传统忽然消失就活不下去的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "倒不如说我一直很奇怪，传统只是将人们聚集到一起的仪式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但是当一个传统延续了几十年，你们就会莫名其妙认为它是不可侵犯的，不可打破的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "实际上完全不会有这样的事！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "所以当你说出要轰掉神庙时我是举双手双脚还有尾巴赞成的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "噢，不对，举双手双脚我就不能举尾巴了......嗯？或许我可以趴着？让我来试试！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......我明白了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "你到底有几岁啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "年龄？忘了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "而且这是你们用来记录时间的方式，与我无关！虽然我只是已经忘了我是什么时候诞生的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "好吧......不过，不管怎么说，还是得有一个人来做大酋长啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "依娜姆",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "喂，我听说嘉维尔要和祖玛玛再打一场，打完了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "依娜姆",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嘉维尔，你看我干什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "依娜姆，你对当大酋长有没有兴趣？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "依娜姆",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "也就是说，经历了一系列事件后，你们总算是将引擎夺回，并且经过应急处理后，勉强踏上了返程的道路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "是、是的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "博士，我记得我对你说过，飞行器是非常珍贵的交通工具。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "情况特殊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不能怪我。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "既然飞行器处于能够维修的范围内，我不会过多责怪你，不过，维修的费用会算在你和煌的工资中。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "诶，我也要吗......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "精英干员应当承担更多的责任。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "呃，好吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "至于你们带回来的三个人，既然你们认为有成为干员的素质，由博士安排就好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "嘉维尔，这次返乡令你感到满意吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嗯？满意啊，连我也没想到会发生这样的事，很有趣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "事实上我做过博士没有把你带回来的预案。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "为什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "因为我认为你有留在家乡的可能性。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？凯尔希，你这也太见外了吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "但你从未适应过外界的生活，你至今都在以你的方式和这片大地上每天都在发生的事激烈碰撞。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "应该这么说，如果有一天你提出要休息或者离开，我不会意外。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "喂，博士，我不太懂，但是凯尔希这应该是在关心我吧？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，你如果没有别的事，可以先离开。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "啧，博士就喜欢这种时候装死。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "那我就当你是在关心我了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "也许吧。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "不愧是凯尔希，连博士都被绕晕了。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "凯尔希，我不会走的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "我当时决定离开也有一个原因，那就是我确实想当医生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "当然了，当时的我肯定没想到我真的能成为医生，但我现在庆幸自己当时的决定。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "用现代医学的角度来看，我们那里和没有医生也差不多，得了病就是自生自灭，最多对某些很好治疗的疾病有一些土方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "如果我没有走出那里的话，我不会知道这片大地是这样子的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "我不会知道原来很多病根本不用死，我不会知道矿石病原来是遭人唾弃的，我不会知道救人和打人一样让我快乐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "虽然外面确实很复杂，我经常搞不懂一些人的目的，也搞不懂为什么要打起来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "但我现在是医生，我的理想是治疗矿石病。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "这片大地上还有更适合我学习当医生的地方吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我想恐怕是没有的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "那不就是了。而且你们一个个的天天比我还累，还要来关心我算什么事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "要我说，凯尔希，我来关心你还差不多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "我不在的时候你没有擅自把我的工作揽过去勉强自己吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "并没有。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "那就好，我要去给祖玛玛检查矿石病了，你们慢慢聊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "啊，那我也去看看克玛尔，哦，现在应该叫燧石了，我去看看她，语言不通，她怕是又要和别人打起来......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "博士，特米米应该在常识课那边，你结束了记得去看一眼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "嘉维尔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "欢迎回来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "哈哈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "咦，我呢？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "你的下一个任务在上个星期就准备好了，理论上来说你已经拖延了很久。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "哦......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "这对你来说应当是一次有些脱离常识的旅行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "但是，如同嘉维尔的性格一样，这也是这片大地充满生机的证明。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "漫长的时间中，许多事物已经被磨灭了它原有的色彩，过去的理所当然变成了如今的难能可贵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我们不得不去寻找人群的细缝间所漏出的光明，并把这种行为视作常态。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "希望这次旅行能让你和同行的干员明白，有些东西并非遥不可及。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希尔",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "凯尔希，该开会了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我知道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "那么，Dr.{@nickname}，还有许多工作在等着你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "希望你在这次休假中获得了足够的休息。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
